<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_restart_all_services">ActionRestartAllServices</link> Handles restarting all services with a single splash screen showing progress. Stops all services first, then starts them all. </para>
<para>
Definition at line <link linkend="_class_8action_8restart_all_services_8php_source_1l00015">15</link> of file <link linkend="_class_8action_8restart_all_services_8php_source">class.action.restartAllServices.php</link>.</para>
</section>
